{"4496420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elite MMA Manager", "steam_appid": 4496420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/009a897185bd5e886bda2cfd76a8a8a3.avif?t=1786227058\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control Careers &amp; Shape the MMA World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing - no reputation, no connections, no champions. Just bums to represent, an eye for talent, and the ambition to build something real in one of the most unforgiving industries on earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite MMA Manager puts you in the role of a professional fight manager navigating the chaotic, political world of combat sports. Sign raw prospects. Negotiate with promotions that don't respect you yet. Build relationships, play the long game, and turn unknowns into world champions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the world doesn't wait for you. Fighters age. Promotions have agendas. Rivals are signing your targets. Every decision - who to sign, when to push, when to protect. shapes careers, rankings, and your place in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/4a93a491192d2b0c0a3b50c3a6832407.avif?t=1786227058\" width=630 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout and sign fighters across multiple weightclasses - raw prospects, proven veterans, hidden gems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/3532b8993903c50f341eb397db8523f2.webp?t=1786227058\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/3532b8993903c50f341eb397db8523f2.poster.avif?t=1786227058\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=337 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate contracts with promotions, sponsors, and training camps to get the best deals for your clients.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/c4f55476534119aba6535ced0eace9eb.poster.avif?t=1786227058\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/c4f55476534119aba6535ced0eace9eb.webm?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/c4f55476534119aba6535ced0eace9eb.mp4?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage fighter personalities, ambitions, morale, and loyalty - not every fighter is handled the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/e1c01feb9e451caa69db56db8ed27073.poster.avif?t=1786227058\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/e1c01feb9e451caa69db56db8ed27073.webm?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/e1c01feb9e451caa69db56db8ed27073.mp4?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/1e33d1a37306eb8cb3a430405554a9a5.avif?t=1786227058\" width=630 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a roster of clients with depth and balance as your reputation grows and bigger opportunities open up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/91c3da94acdff1fe0b31844371b231c0.poster.avif?t=1786227058\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/91c3da94acdff1fe0b31844371b231c0.webm?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/91c3da94acdff1fe0b31844371b231c0.mp4?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/9aeffd8f1f0c34efcc5e9f6c374fe5ad.avif?t=1786227058\" width=630 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the MMA world evolve dynamically around you - rivalries form, champions fall, opportunities appear and disappear.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/6b17f34ec48daf442fc31d806c89503d.poster.avif?t=1786227058\" width=600 height=337 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/6b17f34ec48daf442fc31d806c89503d.webm?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Text-based immersive live fight system, press conferences, and weight-ins for a full Fight Night experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/8f8dd306a3e6ffeeae43bde7085b1d8e.poster.avif?t=1786227058\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/8f8dd306a3e6ffeeae43bde7085b1d8e.webm?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/8f8dd306a3e6ffeeae43bde7085b1d8e.mp4?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every career path is different. No two playthroughs are the same...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is the game MMA fans have been waiting for.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/009a897185bd5e886bda2cfd76a8a8a3.avif?t=1786227058\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Control Careers &amp; Shape the MMA World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with nothing - no reputation, no connections, no champions. Just bums to represent, an eye for talent, and the ambition to build something real in one of the most unforgiving industries on earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite MMA Manager puts you in the role of a professional fight manager navigating the chaotic, political world of combat sports. Sign raw prospects. Negotiate with promotions that don't respect you yet. Build relationships, play the long game, and turn unknowns into world champions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the world doesn't wait for you. Fighters age. Promotions have agendas. Rivals are signing your targets. Every decision - who to sign, when to push, when to protect. shapes careers, rankings, and your place in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/4a93a491192d2b0c0a3b50c3a6832407.avif?t=1786227058\" width=630 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scout and sign fighters across multiple weightclasses - raw prospects, proven veterans, hidden gems.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/3532b8993903c50f341eb397db8523f2.webp?t=1786227058\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/3532b8993903c50f341eb397db8523f2.poster.avif?t=1786227058\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=337 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotiate contracts with promotions, sponsors, and training camps to get the best deals for your clients.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/c4f55476534119aba6535ced0eace9eb.poster.avif?t=1786227058\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/c4f55476534119aba6535ced0eace9eb.webm?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4496420/extras/c4f55476534119aba6535ced0eace9eb.mp4?t=1786227058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage fighter personalities, ambitions, morale, and loyalty - not every fighter is handled the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted